{"seq": 1, "ts": "2026-08-04T18:52:00+00:00", "v": 1, "op": "proposal_committed", "id": "prop_chip8_001", "reason": "Decompose a CHIP-8 emulator for Proof #2. Six independent subsystems (CPU, memory, timers, display, input, ROM) joined by a fetch-decode-execute loop, then a fine-grained opcode dispatch. Subsystem-dense: ~24 opcode units + 9 test groups stress the dependency DAG (claim C7) while proving language/domain generality over the flask web example (C1, C2).", "confidence": 0.8}
